{"1900020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PunjiVR: The Vietnam War", "steam_appid": 1900020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>PunjiVR's History</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PunjiVR originally started development as a hobby project, and I worked on it consistently (as a solo developer) for nearly 5 years. In that time, I created two versions of the game (Version 1 and Version 2; both are playable to owners of PunjiVR) and published nearly 30 major updates between both of those versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, I'm no longer able to continue development on PunjiVR. There are a lot of major plans and ideas that I won't be able to implement, and the game doesn't come close to my original intended vision. However, there is still a lot of solid and interesting content available as is, and I would recommend you try it out if you're interested in a unique VR experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My hope is that the features and content in PunjiVR inspire future developers, games, and ideas. I'm still proud of what I made, and I believe that it can have an impact on the future of VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who joined and supported me on the 5-year development journey; I'm sorry that I'm not able to push the project further, but I hope the jungle still can provide enough fun for what it is. Thank you all.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/extras/9feb8f9dc4a559cdb1524d28c029444f.avif?t=1784994789\" width=618 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PunjiVR</u></strong> aims to create a realistic but accessible war experience that takes full advantage of Virtual Reality.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique and Satisfying Gunplay:</strong> <i>(Physics-Based Recoil, Weapon Jamming, Weapon Sway, Advanced Handling, &amp; More!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Eargasmic</i> Audio:</strong> <i>(Realistic Weapon Sounds, Distance Propagation, Environmental Reverb)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent &amp; Challenging AI:</strong><i> (Take Cover, Communication, Flanking, Suppression, &amp; More!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Lethality:</strong><i> (Realistic Damage and Ballistic Models, Ricochets, Bullet Penetration, Bullet Drop)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique &amp; Replayable Mission Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Variety of Weapons &amp; Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Loadouts &amp; Advanced Inventory System:</strong><i> (Item weight and bulk affect how much you can store, but also your speed, agility, visibility, and weapon handling)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>VR-First Design:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PunjiVR is developed <i>solely</i> as a Virtual Reality experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Body Physics <i>(including physical jumping, crawling, &amp; climbing)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Locomotion Controls<i> (combination of joystick movement with armswinger)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic &amp; Interactive Weapon Handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI and No Laser Pointers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Inventory System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of Settings/Options to make PunjiVR <i>yours</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Inventory System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PunjiVR utilizes the unique features and aspects of VR to create a new style of tactical shooter that immerses you into the conflicts of Southeast Asia like no other. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/extras/9feb8f9dc4a559cdb1524d28c029444f.avif?t=1784994789\" width=618 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PunjiVR</u></strong> aims to create a realistic but accessible war experience that takes full advantage of Virtual Reality.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique and Satisfying Gunplay:</strong> <i>(Physics-Based Recoil, Weapon Jamming, Weapon Sway, Advanced Handling, &amp; More!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Eargasmic</i> Audio:</strong> <i>(Realistic Weapon Sounds, Distance Propagation, Environmental Reverb)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent &amp; Challenging AI:</strong><i> (Take Cover, Communication, Flanking, Suppression, &amp; More!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Lethality:</strong><i> (Realistic Damage and Ballistic Models, Ricochets, Bullet Penetration, Bullet Drop)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique &amp; Replayable Mission Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large Variety of Weapons &amp; Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Loadouts &amp; Advanced Inventory System:</strong><i> (Item weight and bulk affect how much you can store, but also your speed, agility, visibility, and weapon handling)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>VR-First Design:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PunjiVR is developed <i>solely</i> as a Virtual Reality experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Body Physics <i>(including physical jumping, crawling, &amp; climbing)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Locomotion Controls<i> (combination of joystick movement with armswinger)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic &amp; Interactive Weapon Handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI and No Laser Pointers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Inventory System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of Settings/Options to make PunjiVR <i>yours</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Inventory System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PunjiVR utilizes the unique features and aspects of VR to create a new style of tactical shooter that immerses you into the conflicts of Southeast Asia like no other. </p>", "short_description": "PunjiVR is an unforgiving tactical shooter set during the Vietnam War. It experiments with and takes full advantage of the VR medium, including unique features like: Physics-based movement (climbing, crawling, running), a unique inventory system, ballistics, physics-based gunplay, and so much more.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/header.jpg?t=1784994789", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784994789", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784994789", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum specs are based on PCVR requirements and may be lower than the game requires. Use the recommended specs for a better guideline</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-10400F / Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Camden Cleveland"], "publishers": ["Camden Cleveland"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1299, "final": 1299, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$12.99"}, "packages": [684312], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy PunjiVR: The Vietnam War", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 684312, "percent_savings_text": " "